      "value": "<p>The M-9 Tempest is an Alliance-issue submachine gun optimized for the highest sustained fire rate of any one-handed weapon in service. Its enormous heat sink holds one hundred rounds that it can expend in seconds, filling a volume with kinetic fire that makes individual accuracy less critical than statistical certainty. The Tempest is light enough that experienced users can sprint and fire simultaneously without significant penalty.</p>"
